# Copy to .env.docker.local, then fill in all three values privately.
# This file intentionally contains NO working credentials.
# Use NEW practice-only passwords, never your Windows/Ubuntu/production passwords.
# SQL_PASSWORD: at least 16 characters, including uppercase, lowercase, digit,
# and a symbol. For this connection-string example use only A-Z a-z 0-9 ! @ # _ -.
# DEMO_PASSWORD: 16+ characters with uppercase, lowercase, digit, and a symbol.
# JWT_SIGNING_KEY: a random value of at least 64 characters.
# Do not paste .env.docker.local, docker inspect, or full compose config into chat.
SQL_PASSWORD=
DEMO_PASSWORD=
JWT_SIGNING_KEY=
